{"3997040": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Shrimad Bhagavad Gita VR", "steam_appid": 3997040, "required_age": 0, "is_free": true, "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>KlipVR brings you Shrimad Bhagavad Gita in VR</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>“Experience timeless wisdom in immersive reality—anytime, anywhere.”</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In today’s fast-paced world, many feel overwhelmed, disconnected, and spiritually fatigued. Ancient wisdom like the Bhagavad Gita often remains out of reach—too abstract, too time-consuming, and not engaging enough for younger generations.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >That’s why we created <strong>Shrimad Bhagavad Gita in Virtual Reality</strong>—a fully immersive, interactive experience that brings the teachings of the Gita to life.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Walk through the battlefield of Kurukshetra.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Hear Krishna’s guidance in your home.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Make choices as Arjuna and reflect on dharma.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Meditate with verse-based guidance.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This is not just a spiritual experience—it’s a journey of clarity, courage, and connection.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Let Lord Krishna speak to your soul through immersive reality.</p>", "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>KlipVR brings you Shrimad Bhagavad Gita in VR</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>“Experience timeless wisdom in immersive reality—anytime, anywhere.”</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In today’s fast-paced world, many feel overwhelmed, disconnected, and spiritually fatigued. Ancient wisdom like the Bhagavad Gita often remains out of reach—too abstract, too time-consuming, and not engaging enough for younger generations.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >That’s why we created <strong>Shrimad Bhagavad Gita in Virtual Reality</strong>—a fully immersive, interactive experience 